{"unit_id":"CMD128__dsh-wx-bridge#card-zh","repo":"CMD128/dsh-wx-bridge","commit":"3ca7d0c705cae4010c9b6393c736dc0b0de5371c","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-wx-bridge 是面向 DSH Web 的微信 ClawBot 桥接插件。它通过扫码登录腾讯 iLink，将微信私聊消息转发为 DSH 会话提示，并在任务结束时推送摘要。用户可在微信中浏览和切换会话、选择模型或人格、控制任务、查看输出，并审批请求或收取工作区文件；设置页可查看连接状态并管理绑定。适合希望从微信远程操控 DSH 的用户。使用前需准备微信 ClawBot 账号并扫码绑定，插件通过 iLink 服务收发消息。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:24-65","lib/bridge.js:1-12","lib/ilink-channel.js:1-8"]}
{"unit_id":"CMD128__dsh-wx-bridge#card-en","repo":"CMD128/dsh-wx-bridge","commit":"3ca7d0c705cae4010c9b6393c736dc0b0de5371c","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-wx-bridge links DSH Web sessions to WeChat through Tencent iLink. After QR login, chats become session prompts and completion summaries return to WeChat. Users can switch sessions or models, approve requests, control tasks, and receive workspace files. Requires a WeChat ClawBot account.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:24-65","lib/bridge.js:1-12","lib/ilink-channel.js:1-8"]}
